H1('8. End-to-End Execution Flows')
flows=[
('Startup','Docker starts PostgreSQL -> healthcheck -> Spring -> healthcheck -> Next. Next entrypoint runs prisma db push with retries, then npm start. Spring Hibernate also performs ddl-auto=update.'),
('Login','POST form to Next /api/auth/login -> compare ADMIN_USERNAME/PASSWORD -> HMAC token payload {username,role:ADMIN} -> HttpOnly, SameSite=Lax, Secure in production cookie -> redirect. No expiry exists inside token; cookie has session lifetime in Next and 24h in Spring variant.'),
('Sync','UI -> Next -> Spring SyncService -> create RUNNING SyncJob -> GitHub paginated repos -> for each repo collaborators and permission calls -> isolated transaction upserts repository/users and replaces access -> inactive missing repos -> finalize job + audit -> refresh UI.'),
('Map identity','MappingForm -> Next handler -> Spring EmployeeService -> load GitHub user and optional employee -> set relation -> save -> Next separately records audit event.'),
('Immediate employee removal','UI confirms -> Spring collects every mapped GitHub identity/repository pair -> GitHub DELETE each -> isolated DB deletion -> detach identity when no access remains -> audit summary -> UI result.'),
('Approval-gated bulk offboarding','Create batch and items -> create PENDING approval -> governance APPROVE -> mark batch approved -> synchronously create and execute one offboarding job per employee -> finalize item/batch statuses -> audit.'),
('Failure behavior','Sync records FAILED or PARTIAL_SUCCESS. Offboarding treats a GitHub “not found” message as already removed; other errors mark item/request failed. Transactions isolate each repository/access deletion, but external GitHub deletion and local DB update are not one atomic transaction.')]
for name,desc in flows: S += [P(name,'H2X'),P(desc)]
S += [P('Sync sequence diagram','H2X'),code('''Admin   Browser/Next        Spring SyncService       GitHub         PostgreSQL\n | click     |                     |                     |                |\n |---------->| POST /api/sync      |                     |                |\n |           |-------------------->| create RUNNING job  |--------------->|\n |           |                     | GET /user/repos ---->|                |\n |           |                     |<---- repositories ---|                |\n |           |                     | loop: collaborators + permission      |\n |           |                     | upsert repo/users/access ------------>|\n |           |                     | finalize job + audit ---------------->|\n |           |<--------------------| result JSON          |                |\n |<----------| toast + refresh     |                     |                |''')]

